{
  "originalRequest": "Synthetic teaching example of an instrument state machine. States: Idle, Running, Paused, Completed. Initial dot enters Idle. Transitions: Idle→Running: start; Running→Paused: pause; Paused→Running: resume; Running→Completed: finish; Paused→Idle: cancel; Completed→Idle: reset. Each named state appears once. Arrows are labelled events, not process activities. Completed is not a terminal state because reset returns to Idle. English text. Reference is for structural design only.",
  "methodology": "Synthetic teaching example of an instrument state machine. States: Idle, Running, Paused, Completed. Initial dot enters Idle. Transitions: Idle→Running: start; Running→Paused: pause; Paused→Running: resume; Running→Completed: finish; Paused→Idle: cancel; Completed→Idle: reset. Each named state appears once. Arrows are labelled events, not process activities. Completed is not a terminal state because reset returns to Idle. English text. Reference is for structural design only.",
  "visualIntent": "Explicit synthetic teaching example",
  "completePlan": "Generate a Left-to-Right State Transition Diagram on a white background.\n\n**Nodes:**\n1.  **Initial Dot:** Solid black circle on the far left.\n2.  **Idle:** Rounded rectangle, white fill, black border. Positioned to the right of the initial dot.\n3.  **Running:** Rounded rectangle, white fill, black border. Positioned to the right of Idle.\n4.  **Paused:** Rounded rectangle, white fill, black border. Positioned directly BELOW Running.\n5.  **Completed:** Rounded rectangle, white fill, black border. Positioned to the right of Running.\n\n**Edges & Labels:**\n-   **Init -> Idle:** Straight horizontal arrow. No label.\n-   **Idle -> Running:** Straight horizontal arrow. Label \"start\" above.\n-   **Running -> Paused:** Straight vertical arrow downwards. Label \"pause\" to the right.\n-   **Paused -> Running:** Straight vertical arrow upwards (parallel to pause). Label \"resume\" to the left.\n-   **Running -> Completed:** Straight horizontal arrow. Label \"finish\" above.\n-   **Paused -> Idle:** Curved arrow starting from left/bottom of Paused, sweeping DOWN and LEFT to enter the bottom of Idle. Label \"cancel\" below the curve.\n-   **Completed -> Idle:** Long curved arrow starting from top/right of Completed, arcing OVER the top of Running and Idle, entering the top of Idle. Label \"reset\" at the apex of the arc.\n\n**Style:**\n-   All lines and text must be black (#000000).\n-   Node interiors must be white (#FFFFFF).\n-   Font: Noto Sans, bold for states, regular for labels.\n-   Ensure no overlapping lines; use distinct curves for feedback loops.",
